#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SE2253-A expect=violation domain=TT
#note "TTDUR is not present in the dataset (Requirements.Variables.None satisfied) and TTENRL is blank on row 2 -> that Repro Stage has neither an end rule nor a planned duration, and this R-5.25 split sibling reports it AT ITS ROW. Row 1 populates TTENRL and stays silent. This is the state the parent's All [TTENRL, TTDUR] gate now skips - the finding moved here, it was not lost (wave E four-state decomposition)."
#library standard=sendig version=dart-1-1
#expectViolationCount 1
#expectViolationAt row=2 RSTGCD=ST2 TTENRL=
dataset TT class="TRIAL DESIGN" label="Trial Repro Stages"
col STUDYID type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN  type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col RSTGCD  type=Char label="Repro Stage Code"
col RSTAGE  type=Char label="Description of Repro Stage"
col TTENRL  type=Char label="Repro Stage End Rule"
---
S1 | TT | ST1 | Premating | MATING SUCCESS
S1 | TT | ST2 | Gestation |
